        "original_id": "afaadd76-8460-5e97-9761-d8eb211025cb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Polly Draper, Tim Roth, Nat Wolff, Alex Wolff\n- Works: Thirtysomething, The Hit, The Naked Brothers Band\n- Organizations: ABC, Nickelodeon\n- Roles: actor, director, actress, producer\n\nFacts:\n- Tim Roth was born on 14 May 1961 and is an English actor and director.\n- Tim Roth received critical acclaim for playing Myron in the 1984 film The Hit and earned his first BAFTA Award nomination for that role.\n- Polly Draper first gained recognition for her role in the ABC primetime television drama Thirtysomething, which ran from 1987 to 1991.\n- Nat Wolff and Alex Wolff are known for their work on the Nickelodeon television series The Naked Brothers Band.\n- Polly Draper created and produced The Naked Brothers Band and is the mother of Nat Wolff and Alex Wolff.",
